{"name": "TavernHold", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/05657b6f6d96d6c7d66c9bfc4a0dd77e.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tavernhold</strong> is a single-player mix of daylight inn-management and nighttime tower defense. Build up a profitable roadside tavern, gather the resources you need, and hold the line when undead waves march on your gate.\u00a0Guard the inn\u2014if it falls, your fight is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/cdb9eba58e6bd47a66116edc4934eb8e.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/c3738ec9a57063fcbdc41e059a312cb7.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/c3738ec9a57063fcbdc41e059a312cb7.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/c3738ec9a57063fcbdc41e059a312cb7.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire your workers to assign them\u00a0where they\u2019re needed most: gathering food and timber, constructing new rooms and tables, repairing defenses, or manning the walls when night falls.<br/>Feed travelers and rent out rooms to earn gold, then reinvest it into more workers, faster resource nodes, and stronger defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend wood to add tables, guest rooms, spike traps, stronger gates, or new resource outposts. Decide what matters most before the night arrives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/1c085953e034d1011c86ed0e41839f3e.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/dabbb3bd1176a56abe7817a67ef1ce65.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/dabbb3bd1176a56abe7817a67ef1ce65.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/dabbb3bd1176a56abe7817a67ef1ce65.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A roguelike twist on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive a random bonus at the start of each day that changes how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As days pass, the chances of stronger bonuses increase, pushing you to adapt and plan ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/9ad4dc5c162e31cc3a4bc9c0fbbeb91f.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/6f833b2f60b1c2ec096c9e46bf842187.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/6f833b2f60b1c2ec096c9e46bf842187.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/6f833b2f60b1c2ec096c9e46bf842187.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design the battlefield your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape enemy paths, place defenses at key locations, and experiment with different strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your plans come together as each night puts your design to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/b81e6bcd9629ebeb0f33a9eb628ca396.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/d872fa0a19b03f5e3ff085ed9941e131.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/d872fa0a19b03f5e3ff085ed9941e131.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/d872fa0a19b03f5e3ff085ed9941e131.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At night, place your workers onto the walls to shoot the enemies and take direct control of a giant ballista. Slow the undead horde with spike traps, pierce clustered enemies with well-placed bolts, and keep your enemies away from breaching the gate\u2014too many slip through and it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/a68931326e71a556a7922da3a7e32d35.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"316\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/bc252fd8759ce6ae11b66efb9964c181.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/bc252fd8759ce6ae11b66efb9964c181.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/bc252fd8759ce6ae11b66efb9964c181.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through a branching research tree to strengthen your inn and defenses. Upgrade your rooms and tables to earn more gold, empower workers and traps for stronger defense, and enhance your ballista with new arrow types to hold back the undead army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/323025a5b1d9642490cea9e344ba5810.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/fc4847f371db8c8015257dddacb79b3f.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/fc4847f371db8c8015257dddacb79b3f.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/fc4847f371db8c8015257dddacb79b3f.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock special arrow types and craft them for battle. Explosive bolts tear through clustered enemies, while frost bolts slow the horde\u2014stock up and fire them at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/6d28df7bee91a42cf0ee03b2038cbff2.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"1131\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/7be6c18616dce9046d876c1424101229.poster.avif?t=1767974498\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/7be6c18616dce9046d876c1424101229.webm?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/extras/7be6c18616dce9046d876c1424101229.mp4?t=1767974498\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every few nights, powerful bosses lead the undead army to your gates! Defend against them with upgraded defenses, crafted arrows, and careful worker placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the daily rhythm of gather-build-serve, then withstand each night\u2019s siege to keep your tavern from falling!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build, manage and defend your fantasy tavern.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863310/fcbf40e67719b569e40d4fc67674b46842abc0c8/header.jpg?t=1767974498", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Resource Management", "Tower Defense", "Base Building", "Roguelite", "Management", "Incremental"], "developers": "Tevniyal Studios", "publishers": "Tevniyal Studios", "release_date": "Jan 9, 2026", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3863310", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "15 September 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/aQoIFS6wtAs", "first_seen": 1757887200.0, "review_rank": 1486}